{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_chat_013_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_chat_013_1000_037nao", "source_sha256": "18228a5e172d4f45235a4efbd99ebaa4bdd117093939f40d5be93747126fb901", "ja": "この前、杏奈がやってたゲーム、\n私もやってみたけど難しいなあ。\nボスが強すぎるわ～。", "zh": "之前杏奈玩的那个游戏，\n我也开始玩了，可是好难喔。\n魔王太强了啦～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_chat_013_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_chat_013_1001_024ann", "source_sha256": "ae1c220b5fb1ca874c7a3a025f241ac1a4f55f83c549db6945ec1bb924e95475", "ja": "……あの子、は……\nちょっとコツがいる……\nから…………。", "zh": "……要打赢他……\n有诀窍…………", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_chat_013_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_chat_013_1002_037nao", "source_sha256": "35b29bfaf45cf27dbc4852a100966002bd5ce496c191b39273ce683a590477b1", "ja": "そのコツ、教えてくれへん！？\n一人ではもう無理な気してて…。", "zh": "可以告诉我那个诀窍吗！？\n只靠我自己应该打不赢……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_chat_013_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_chat_013_1003_026yur", "source_sha256": "55c859a619a70aeb1429fe99c58843c71753187b264a648220754b4d5dc2c99f", "ja": "もしかして、そのゲームって、\n前に私もやってたあれかな？\n少し前から話題になってる……。", "zh": "你们说的游戏，\n是不是我也有玩的那款？\n前阵子很多人在讨论……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_chat_013_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_chat_013_1004_024ann", "source_sha256": "2f8f8c98b892783ca59c68a9802648f8d143f91f50d04ae53ad61046bc15b6c6", "ja": "あ……そ、だよ……。\nでも、百合子さん……、すぐ……\nクリアしちゃった、って…………。", "zh": "啊……对呀……\n不过百合子……不是……\n很快就破关了吗…………", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_chat_013_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_chat_013_1005_037nao", "source_sha256": "3457ede32b51d320b39c3d6f50253667cd8c7864c723486400a11382886b3d20", "ja": "ええっ、そうなん？\nそんなん聞くと悔しいやん。じゃあ、\n私もアドバイスなしでクリアするわ！", "zh": "咦咦，真的吗？\n听你这么说我觉得好不甘心呀。\n那我也要凭自己的实力破关！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_chat_013_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_chat_013_1006_024ann", "source_sha256": "5044ab42e1cbb6b21b3f055bc8d1ce73a62c74edeb72e9d460b01cbde8d3d6ba", "ja": "……ふふ、がんばって……。\n……応援いる時は……言って……ね。", "zh": "……呵呵，加油……\n需要声援的时候……再跟杏奈……说喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
